==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*kʷ-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|ничьто}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*ničьto}}. {{surf|ru|ни-|что́|t1=not|t2=what}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ничто́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-ничто.ogg}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|ru|pronoun|head=ничто́|g=n}}

# ''(indefinite pronoun)'' [[nothing]]
#: {{usex|ru|'''Ничто́''' [[не]] [[говорить|говори́ло]] (o [[что-либо|чём-либо]]).|'''Nothing''' foretold (of anything).}}

====Usage notes====
* The nominative and accusative are usually replaced by the genitive {{l|ru|ничего́}} in colloquial speech, and may be considered synonyms.
* With prepositions, {{m-self|ru|ничто́}} is split into {{m|ru|ни}} and {{m-self|ru|что}}, with the preposition in between, such as in {{m|ru|ни за что|t=not for anything}}.

